Example 1:
Input: @int = (11, 8, 27, 4)
Output: (11, 4, 8, 27)

Prime factors of 11 => 11
Prime factors of  4 => 2, 2
Prime factors of  8 => 2, 2, 2
Prime factors of 27 => 3, 3, 3

Example 2:
Input: @int = (2, 4, 8, 12, 11)
Output: (2, 11, 4, 8, 12)

Prime factors of  2 => 2
Prime factors of 11 => 11
Prime factors of  4 => 2, 2
Prime factors of  8 => 2, 2, 2
Prime factors of 12 => 2, 2, 3

